					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120302,
					"content": "找到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205120303,
					"content": "這…看起來確實…很濃郁啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120304,
					"content": "這東西真的能入藥嗎，做好了藥，我得自己先試試。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120305,
					"content": "#假如我出了什麼事，安娜就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120306,
					"content": "…交給葛瑞絲修女照顧了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120307,
					"content": "#然後告訴她，我去很遠的地方工作了，拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了，這是我最後的願望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120308,
					"content": "沒事的，你別自己嚇自己…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205120309,
					"content": "#因為這藥看起來就很嚇人啊！總之，這些{F#妳}{M#你}先收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120310,
					"content": "一定要記得我說的話啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				}
